Welcome to DoelzaberiOS

  doas <command>        become root (your account is in the wheel group)
  doelzaberi-gui        start the wayland session (weston)
       --pixman         software renderer, if the card has no EGL driver
  doelzaberi-install    install this system on a disk (root only)
  curl                  https works out of the box (ca-certificates)

The fish shell is the default shell and it is already configured.
